[Am] Jaise koi sur mila ho,        [G] Dil ke taar se [F] dil ke taar ka
[Am] Pal ki hansi mein,        [Am] Yunhi dillagi mein yeh dil [G] gaya
[G] Hamein kya mila hai,        [G] Tumhe to mera dil bhi mil [Am] gaya
[Am] Leke pyaar aanhkon [G] mein,        [F] Leke pyaar aankhon [G] mein aao [Am] na
[Am] Bhigi bhigi raaton men fir tum [G] aao na,        [F] Aisi barasaaton men [G] ...aao [Am] na
[Am] Aa rahi hai teri yaadein,        [G] Dil mera phir be [F] qaraar hai
[Am] Tum milogi, haan milogi,        [G] Dil ko mere ait [F] baar hai
[Am] Khuli hai yeh baahein,        [Am] Dekhe yeh nigaahein rasta [G] tera
[G] Zara muskuraake,        [G] phir se dikha de vohi [Am] adaa
[Am] Ya to meri yaadon [G] mein,        [F] Ya to meri yaadon [G] mein aao [Am] na
